Optional GPS server configuration for crDroid 17.0 (Android 17)
Public edition prepared 2026-10-01.
crDroid 17.0 edition, 2026-10-20: strict apply and reverse at the reference commits in this
NOTICE. Configuration verified on a OnePlus 13 on 2026-10-27 (crDroid 17.0 build of
2026-10-25, repository commit 4bdecab): /odm/etc/gps.conf carries both settings and the GNSS
service runs; a satellite fix on 17.0 is still to be observed. The crDroid 16.0 edition is
kept on branch 16.0 of this repository.

Reference repositories, commits and public sources:
  device/oneplus/sm8750-common c63ac897067e072fd6bb9306a5c0c8aa6c1b4d11 https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android_device_oneplus_sm8750-common

The patches only change GNSS configuration: SUPL_HOST/SUPL_PORT and NTP_SERVER.
They contain no modem firmware, binary GNSS implementation or server software.
Keep upstream file notices and terms. This module's changes and documentation
are provided under Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The SUPL hostname refers to the independently operated GrapheneOS service.
GrapheneOS documentation: https://grapheneos.org/faq#other-connections
The NTP hostname refers to the German pool, not a guaranteed dedicated server.
NTP Pool documentation: https://www.ntppool.org/en/zone/de
These service references are not an endorsement or availability guarantee.

Reference configuration: OnePlus SM8750 common tree; OnePlus 13 context.
Source apply/reverse checks do not establish effective modem server selection,
SUPL privacy properties, fix time or GNSS accuracy on a running device.

